- `:221-222` — "Toolkit gaps … `OpBuildLess_v0`/`OpBuildEqual_v0`, `OpBuildOrArray_v0`, **`OpBuildCaseBool_v0` (selector from a node output)**, `OpExitCase_v0`. **Estimated 4 ops.**"
